c. Flood limit line corresponding to the 100-year floodplain elevation shall be shown. Indicate panel number and year of the flood insurance map;
d. Location, description and dimensions of any stormwater runoff retention/detention facility and to include an access easement thereto having a minimum width of 20 feet and not more than 20 percent longitudinal gradient;
e. Location and dimensions of any public and private water systems and fire hydrants;
f. Location and specifications for all streetlights;
g. All water and wastewater systems and fire hydrants shall be provided for in compliance with all applicable requirements of Rockdale Water Resources;
